383,customer,88-1,Chairman
384,customer,88-2,NAM Chair
385,customer_comment,0-2,Hello. You've got a great mall here.
386,customer_comment,0-3,I never want to go home.
387,customer_comment,1-2,I just love shopping here.
388,customer_comment,1-3,But sometimes I spend too much. Heh heh...
389,customer_comment,2-2,Hi. I'm feeling great today.
390,customer_comment,2-3,But that's true every day.
391,customer_comment,3-2,I love it when stores hold sales during the Sale Season.
392,customer_comment,3-3,It's so exciting.
393,customer_comment,4-2,It seems that a Fever lasts for 4 weeks. Did you know that?
394,customer_comment,4-3,Oh, you did? Never mind, then...
395,customer_comment,5-2,High Quality just makes me want to buy, buy, buy!
396,customer_comment,6-2,I always like to check out stores that have good Rep.
397,customer_comment,6-3,They're usually the best, after all.
398,customer_comment,7-2,This place is always so nice and clean. I love it.
399,customer_comment,8-2,I often end up going to the stores that are next to the ones I came to shop at.
400,customer_comment,8-3,Sometimes I end up buying too much like that.
401,customer_comment,9-2,Stairs and escalators are okay, but I really prefer elevators.
402,customer_comment,9-3,They're the most convenient.
403,customer_comment,10-2,You can often find store combos by switching around your stores' locations.
404,customer_comment,11-2,Riding in a helicopter to go shopping? That's the life...
405,customer_comment,12-2,Being able to come on the bus is really convenient.
406,customer_comment,13-2,I like being able to take the train when I shop.
407,customer_comment,14-2,My record company's doing well, as usual. We've got a lot of new artists.
408,customer_comment,15-2,I'd like to write a book about the banana sorting methods I've seen used at your store.
409,customer_comment,16-2,I was a singer until recently. What should I try next?
410,customer_comment,16-3,Maybe I'll take a trip around the world.
411,customer_comment,17-2,I like to curl up with a cup of cocoa in the winter.
412,customer_comment,17-3,And don't forget the marshmallows!
413,customer_comment,18-2&19-2&20-2&21-2&22-2&23-2&24-2&25-2&26-2&27-2&28-2&29-2&30-2&31-2&32-2&33-2&34-2&35-2&36-2&37-2&38-2, 
414,evtmsgs,0-1,The rival mall has taken some of our customers from us...
415,evtmsgs,1-1,Our customers have returned from the rival mall!
416,evtmsgs,2-1,The customers are very excited about the new Bus Stop!
417,evtmsgs,3-1,The customers are very excited about the new Subway Station!
418,evtmsgs,4-1,The customers are very excited about the new Heliport!
419,evtmsgs,5-1,<0> is the talk of the town! Our customers love us!
420,evtmsgs,6-1,<0> is very popular! Our customers love us!
421,evtmsgs,7-1,<0> was featured on a TV program. Our customers love us!
422,evtmsgs,8-1,<0> was featured in a magazine article. Our customers love us!
423,evtmsgs,9-1,<0>'s popularity is reaching its peak! Our customers love us!
424,evtmsgs,10-1,We lost a few customers due to the rival mall's advertising campaign...
425,evtmsgs,11-1,We lost a lot of customers due to the rival mall's advertising campaign...
426,evtmsgs,12-1,The rival mall's sales campaign resulted in us losing some customers...
427,evtmsgs,13-1,But their quality just wasn't good enough, so many of the customers have come back to us!
428,evtmsgs,14-1,<0>'s popularity is at its peak! It's Fever time!
429,evtmsgs,15-1,We're not getting many customers thanks to the recession...
430,evtmsgs,16-1,Everyone is talking about <0> becoming a <1>-star mall!
431,evtmsgs,17-1,They got mad at us for not having escalators...
432,evtmsgs,18-1,They got mad at us for not having elevators...
433,evtmsgs,19-1,This month's advertising campaign has brought a few customers back to us!
434,evtmsgs,20-1,This month's advertising campaign has brought a lot of customers back to us!
435,evtmsgs,21-1,This month's sales campaign has brought a few customers back to us!
436,evtmsgs,22-1,This month's sales campaign has brought a lot of customers back to us!
437,evtmsgs,23-1,Congratulations! All of our customers are now regulars!
438,evtmsgs,24-1,Everyone is talking about us in town. We're really getting popular!
439,evtmsgs,25-1,Now that we've reached #1 in the country, we can build a Casino!
440,manual,0-0,In this shopping mall simulation game, you get 15 years to create a 5-star shopping mall filled with shops that customers want to visit.
,,,▼Game Flow 1<br>Try to build shops that your customers will like. When a customer is satisfied with a shop's quality, they become a regular. Regulars tend to spend more money.
,,,▼Game Flow 2<br>Malls are ranked with a 5-star rating system. As you go up in rank, you will get access to more employees and advertising methods. Try to get to 5 stars.
,,,▼Going Up In Rank<br>Your ability to go up in rank depends on things like monthly sales and the number of regular customers. Try to build stores that have high sales, or that will be liked by customers.
,,,▼Adding Stores 1<br>You can get plans for new stores by selecting "Actions" > "Buy Plans" from the menu. You will sometimes get new plans as a gift when a customer becomes a regular.
,,,▼Adding Stores 2<br>Adding new stores will sometimes attract new customers. In some cases, a customer may even ask you to invest in something because they want to move into the area.
,,,▼Making Investments 1<br>You can make investments to attract developments such as apartment complexes and office buildings to the area, increasing your mall's business.
,,,▼Making Investments 2<br>You can also sometimes invest in your own mall, increasing its size or researching things such as escalators. These will be vital if you want to become a mega-mall.
,,,▼Hiring Staff<br>Staff have two roles: handing out hearts and increasing product quality. Some staff are best paired with certain types of stores, so watch where you place them.
,,,▼Staff<br>At first, you won't be able to change your staff, but as your mall gets more floors you will be able to hire more people to manage them. Try investing in your mall to make it bigger.
,,,▼Getting Hearts 1<br>You need hearts to hold sales or get plans for new stores. You get hearts when customers use facilities such as toilets, or when they interact with staff.
,,,▼Getting Hearts 2<br>If you want more hearts, build more facilities or hire a staff member who is particularly thoughtful.
,,,▼Holding Sales<br>Holding a sale makes it more likely for customers to visit a particular store. It can be a useful method of increasing your national rank or of leveling up a store.
,,,▼Fever 1<br>During a Fever, customers from the surrounding area will crowd into your mall. It's a perfect chance to make a lot of sales, but be careful you don't sell out too soon.
,,,▼Fever 2<br>A Fever starts when your mall's Popularity reaches 100. During a Fever, every visitor to your mall will give you a heart, making it a great opportunity to get hearts.
,,,▼Making Store Combos 1<br>A store combo is a combination of stores that, when built next to each other, give bonuses to prices or Rep.
,,,▼Making Store Combos 2<br>To make a combo, all of the stores must be touching in one unbroken line. There are also rumors of a salesman who sells plans for new store combos...
,,,▼Leveling Up Stores<br>Once a store gets a certain number of visitors, it will level up, increasing its sales prices and Rep. You also get bonus points that you can allocate to Quality or Stock.
,,,▼Adding New Services<br>Each store has a variety of services that can be added by spending hearts, which boosts its Quality and Rep. Try adding services to stores with slow sales.
,,,▼Installing Movement Facilities<br>Facilities such as stairways and escalators help customers move around more smoothly, and can greatly affect your sales.
,,,▼Advertising<br>Advertising can increase your mall's Popularity. Advertising is vital if you want to trigger a Fever, although the state of the economy can change its effectiveness.
,,,▼Transportation Facilities<br>As you progress, you will be able to research facilities such as bus stops. These make it easier for customers to access your mall, and can greatly affect your bottom line.
,,,▼Hands in the Air<br>When a customer finds a store they like, they will throw their hands up in the air. If that store's Quality reaches a certain level, they will become a regular of that store.
,,,▼Store Placement 1<br>Place stores with a high Rep on the higher floors of your mall. Grouping many stores with low Rep together won't result in much of an increase in sales.
,,,▼Store Placement 2<br>Placing a store with a high Rep next to a weaker store that you want to level up is an effective strategy. Placing facilities on the same floor as the store will also boost Rep.
,,,▼Store Placement 3<br>Placing multiple facilities of the same type on one floor is not very effective. Try to spread them out. Also avoid building too many facilities.
,,,▼Yearly Store Rank<br>Each year, the store in your mall that earned the most money will compete in the national rankings. Sales are an important factor, but Quality and Reputation also play a part.
,,,▼Game Ending<br>The game will "end" when you reach the end of March of year 16. Your funds and Clear Points will be saved as your high score. However, you can keep playing for as long as you like.
,,,▼Other<br>After beating the game, you will be able to carry over some of your data when starting a new game, making it easier to get a better high score.
,,,(About This Game)
441,news,0-1,A New Mall Opens!
442,news,0-2,There's a new player in the mall industry: <0>. When asked for a comment, the manager's secretary said, "While we have a limited selection at the moment, we're on our way to becoming a one-stop shopping solution." It has been a long time since we've seen a new face in the industry, and we look forward to seeing what will happen in the future.
443,news,1-1,Quality and Reputation
444,news,1-2,<po=m>We often hear from malls trying to improve their sales numbers, so we decide to ask an expert for some advice. "Increase your Quality to encourage people to buy more items at once. And don't forget to put the stores with the highest Reputation higher up in the building."<br><br>It seems that customers have a tendency to shop at stores they pass on the way to or from the main store they want to visit. We'll be sure to pass on any other tidbits of advice we may encounter.
445,news,2-1,A 1-Star Mall
446,news,2-2,<po=m>We've just received word that <0> has become a 1-star mall. Employees and customers alike are overjoyed by this honor. The entire mall looks like one giant party.<br><br>We asked a frequent mall customer for a comment, "We're honored to have <0> in our town. It's wonderful to be able to shop in such a beautiful place." Indeed, our editing staff couldn't help but take the afternoon off for a quick trip to <0>.
447,news,3-1,A 2-Star Mall
448,news,3-2&5-2,dummy
449,news,4-1,A 3-Star Mall
450,news,4-2,We have just learned that thanks to its tireless efforts, <0> has become a 3-star mall. Its steadily increasing customer base and wide variety of stores have attracted attention from industry insiders. We wonder what the future will bring for this rising star.
451,news,5-1,A 4-Star Mall
452,news,6-1,A 5-Star Mall
453,news,6-2,We've just been told that <0>, the mall that this publication has been following since its inception, has been recognized by the Mall Association as a 5-star mall. This is a rare honor that is bestowed to only a handful of malls in the world. We hope the management will take the time for a short celebration before going back to work.
454,news,7-1,Store Combos
455,news,7-2,<0> has created its first store combo. A combo is a group of compatible stores on the same floor. Combos can really boost a store's Reputation and Price, so they're worth looking for. Don't forget that you can use the "Move" command to move a store to a new location without having to rebuild.
456,news,10-1,1,000 Visitors
457,news,10-2,With the help of the National Association of Birdwatchers, <0> has been working to get an accurate tally of visitors, and has just learned that they have had more than 1,000 visitors since opening their doors! Fabulous prizes were distributed to the customers in the mall in honor of this achievement. 10 minutes afterwards, the flustered manager arrived in a tuxedo, mumbling something about being trapped in the bathroom.
458,news,11-1,Bus Stop Opening
459,news,11-2,The bus stop that had been under construction for some time was finally finished today. One happy customer was heard to remark, "It used to take me 2 hours to come on foot, and now it just takes 10 minutes! I can spend that extra time relaxing in a cafe!"
460,news,12-1,Subway Station Opening
461,news,12-2,The subway station that had been under construction for some time was finally finished today. It promises to be a popular stop on a line that connects a variety of commercial locations. One of the workers on the job remarked, "I had to come to the mall for lunch every day during the construction, and now I'm a regular customer!"
462,news,13-1,Heliport Opening
463,news,13-2,We have recently been told that a heliport has been constructed at the <0>. The location is a hit with small children, who like to watch the rich and powerful arrive on helicopters. Just before takeoff, Dutch the helicopter pilot is often heard to yell "Get to da choppa!" to stragglers.
464,news,14-1,Watch Your Stock Levels
465,news,14-2,<po=m>Unexpectedly large crowds at the recently opened <0> have resulted in stock running out before the end of the day. The usually calm manager's secretary was heard to remark in a happy but nervous voice that stock levels would be increasing soon.<br><br>Adding new services to a store can sometimes increase stock levels as well. We hope that each store's manager will do whatever it takes to cope with this incredible demand.
466,news,15-1,High Quality
467,news,15-2,The National Quality Assurance Association recently announced that <0>'s <1> has one of the highest Quality levels in the country. The association's inspector could not hide his surprise that a store that opened not long ago could achieve a Quality score of more than 100. Certainly all eyes will be on <0> in the future.
468,news,16-1,High Reputation
469,news,16-2,According to one of our writers, <0>'s <1> has built up quite a Reputation among shoppers. No matter who he spoke to, everyone had heard good things about the store. A store with a good Rep can attract customers more easily, so <0> is no doubt quite happy about this news.
470,news,18-1,Taking It To The Last Level
471,news,18-2,<po=m>We on the Mall News editorial staff have been following <0> since it first opened, which was why were we particularly interested to see that one of its stores has reached the maximum level--level 10. <0>'s <1> has long been one of the mall's biggest attractions, and boasts a large number of regular customers. "We did it!" a part-time worker at the store was heard to remark. "We really did it!"<br><br>There's no doubt that this will further boost <0>'s already impressive popularity.
472,news,19-1,Silver Screen Shopping
473,news,19-2,According to our sources, <0> now boasts a new movie theater. The opening ceremony was presided over by none other than world-famous director James Cameroon. Excited customers commented that before the theater opened, they had to travel to the next town to see first-run movies. We can't wait to see what <0> has up its sleeve next.
474,news,20-1,Getting Clinical
475,news,20-2,You can add a clinic to the long list of amenities offered by <0>. "We're proud to offer the very latest and best in medical care, right here in the mall," said a clinic representative. A patient who came for treatment for his cold commented that he felt so much better after seeing the doctor that he stayed at the mall to do some shopping. What does <0> have in store for us next?
476,news,21-1,The Age of Aquariums
477,news,21-2,We've just learned of another new addition at up-and-coming shopping mecca <0>. This time, it's an aquarium. <0> is betting that it will be one of the mall's main attractions, and if the reactions of the children watching the exotic fish are any indication, they may be onto something. We'll have to keep an eye on <0>.
478,news,22-1,The House Always Wins
479,news,22-2,<po=m><0> has just opened up a new full-service casino. Customers passing by were excited by this unusual addition to the mall. "It's just like a real casino!" said one. "I feel like I'm in Las Vegas!"<br><br>With the attention that <0> is bringing the region, there can be little doubt that they will be welcoming their share of high rollers in the future.
480,news,23-1,Reach For The Stars
481,news,23-2,There's just no stopping <0> recently. This time, they've added an entire planetarium. In the words of the facility's head, it "allows customers to experience the wonders of the universe through stunning, high-quality visuals." Indeed, the planetarium features the latest in projection equipment found only in a handful of locations around the world. It's sure to be one of the main attractions in an already impressive lineup.
482,news,24-1,How Convenient
483,news,24-2,<0> is rapidly becoming an integral part of the surrounding community, and has just opened a new convenience store. Its biggest draw is its wide selection, featuring everything from household items to snacks and premade lunches. Workers from nearby office buildings are already making a beeline for the store on their lunch hour, and many others stop by to shop and look at the magazines.
484,news,25-1,Service With A Smile
485,news,25-2,<0> has just opened a service counter to assist its many customers. Offering maps, directions, and other services, the service counter is already well on its way to becoming one of the most popular stops for new customers, making <0> even more attractive than before.
486,news,26-1,All Regulars?!
487,news,26-2,<po=m>It's not easy to surprise us after so many years in this business, but <0> has done it. According to our calculations, all of the mall's customers are now regulars! This unheard-of situation has attracted considerable attention in the industry.<br><br>We here at the Mall News have been secretly pulling for <0> for some time, and couldn't be happier about this news. We hope they will continue to inspire us long into the future.
488,news,27-1,Depression
489,news,27-2,The effects of the worldwide economic depression have started to make themselves felt on the mall industry, with many cutting back on advertising or reducing salaries. We'll be following this story closely in the coming days.
