802,talk,0-2,Hello!
,,,I'm your secretary! Pleased to meet you!
,,,We may not be very big at the moment, but we've got 15 years to become a 5-star mall of mega proportions!
,,,Select "How to Play" under the "System" menu to see game instructions.
,,,The mall is about to open, but we don't have any shops! Try building some.
,,,The first step in becoming a 1-star mall is to select "Build" from the menu and select "Bakery."
803,talk,1-2,<0> years have now passed. This marks the end of the first part of the game.
,,,Your Clear Points will now be calculated.
804,talk,2-2,You have <0> total Clear Points.
,,,Congratulations! You beat your high score.
,,,Try to do better in your next play through!
805,talk,3-2,You have <0> total Clear Points.
,,,Sorry. You didn't beat your high score.
,,,Try to do better in your next play through!
806,talk,4-2,From this point onward, your high score will no longer be updated.
,,,But you can continue to play the game as long as you like. Have fun!
807,talk,5-2,<po=m>Your investment has paid off... Construction speed has increased by<co=993300> <co=0066cc><0>%</co>!
,,,Construction progress will now increase by <1>% each week.
808,talk,6-2,Hello. I'm from Pumpkin Products.
,,,I've got some top-secret info you might be interested in...
809,talk,7-2,See you later!
810,talk,8-2,Oops! I just remembered some urgent business I have to attend to. Goodbye for now.
,,,You can see the info you bought by selecting "Info" > "Combos" from the menu.
811,talk,9-2,Welcome.
812,talk,10-2,Uh-oh! I've run out of things to sell!
,,,But I'll have more things available once your mall has gotten a bit bigger. See you then.
813,talk,11-2,I'm sorry. I'm fresh out of things to sell.
,,,You'll have to wait until my next shipment comes in.
814,talk,12-2,Oh dear!
,,,Another mall has opened in the neighborhood!
815,talk,13-2,This could be bad. If we're not careful, we might end up losing customers to this rival mall.
,,,We've got to work hard to make sure that doesn't happen!
816,talk,14-2,I have some news.
,,,You know that other mall that opened nearby?
,,,Well they're going out of business!
817,talk,15-2,Isn't that great?! Now our customers in the neighborhood should come back to us.
,,,And it's all thanks to our management skills. Let's keep up the good work!
818,talk,16-2,When we removed the Lvl. <0> <1>...
,,,We found a new location for it outside the mall! They paid you <2>.
819,talk,17-2,We should get a lot of customers during the Spring Sale Season this month.
,,,The national mall rankings are going to be announced at the end of the month.
,,,You might try running a sale at a store with a connection to spring.
820,talk,18-2,We should get a lot of customers during the Summer Sale Season this month.
,,,Let's see how many we can get!
821,talk,19-2,We should get a lot of customers during the Holiday Sale Season this month.
,,,The national mall rankings are going to be announced at the end of the month.
822,talk,20-2,You worked hard this year. Well done.
823,talk,21-2,You worked hard this year. Well done.
,,,The national mall rankings are about to be announced.
,,,We came in at #<0> last time. I wonder how we'll do this time around?
824,talk,22-2,Our national ranking was #<0>.
,,,Unfortunately, we didn't do better than last time.
,,,Let's get ready for the next sale season.
825,talk,23-2,Congratulations! You finally did it!
,,,Someone from the National Association of Malls is here to congratulate you.
826,talk,24-2,Hello. We're very impressed by how fast your mall has been developing.
,,,So we're happy to announce that your mall has gone up in rank.
,,,You should now be able to build some new stores.
827,talk,25-2,Yes!
,,,Thanks to your management skills, we've been promoted to a <1>-star mall!
,,,We can now research new types of stores! That should help attract more customers.
,,,Keep up the good work!
828,talk,26-2,I'll be doing my best as well!
829,talk,27-2,I'll turn this place into the best mall in the country, guaranteed!
830,talk,28-2,I look forward to working with you.
831,talk,29-2&31-2,I came all the way from the countryside just to work here! Thank you for this opportunity!
832,talk,30-2,Working here has been my dream for as long as I can remember! This is so exciting!
833,talk,36-2,I see...
,,,Thanks for everything. Goodbye.
834,talk,37-2,I see...
,,,I guess it was time for a change anyway. Goodbye.
835,talk,38-2,Oh...
,,,And I thought I was just hitting my stride, too... Well, goodbye...
836,talk,39-2,What?!
,,,I guess I'll have to go back home and try my hand at planting trees or something...
837,talk,40-2,Oh, I see...
,,,I guess I'll go back to my hometown and try writing that novel I've been thinking about. Goodbye.
838,talk,41-2,W-What?! Really?! I see...
,,,I want to just crawl under the covers and sleep...
839,talk,42-2,Hmm... I suppose that's the right decision, from a feng shui perspective.
840,talk,43-2,...That's too bad.
841,talk,46-2,<1> development is currently in progress in the <0>.
,,,You'll have to wait until it finishes.
842,talk,47-2,<0> development is currently underway.
843,talk,48-2,Okay, I'll tell them to start the <0> development.
,,,Please wait for a while until it finishes.
844,talk,49-2,Boss?
,,,You know the <1> development in the <0>?
,,,Well, it just finished!
845,talk,50-2,You use this menu to build stores or facilities.
,,,Building more stores makes it more likely for customers to want to come to the mall. Try to build lots of stores.
846,talk,51-2,You'll need stairways to allow customers to go from one floor to another.
,,,Stairs are very important, so be careful where you build them.
,,,You can use the switch button to flip the direction that a stairway faces.
847,talk,52-2,Facilities are very important--they increase the Rep of all of the stores on the same floor.
,,,And you also get hearts from customers who use them.
,,,But they don't contribute much to sales, so be careful not to build too many of them.
848,talk,53-2,Stores on the "Special" tab are unique stores. You can only have one of them in your mall.
,,,So be careful when building them.
,,,But don't worry--if you remove a unique store, you can build it again.
849,talk,54-2,In this menu, you can invest money in the surrounding areas.
,,,The more developed these areas are, the more customers you will have.
,,,So if you have some extra money, don't be afraid to invest it!
850,talk,55-2,Hello. I'm from Pumpkin Products.
,,,Would you be interested in some plans for new stores?
,,,Let me know if you see a store you'd like to build.
851,talk,56-2,Thank you.
,,,You can call me at any time by selecting "Actions" > "Buy Plans" from the menu.
,,,I look forward to seeing you again soon.
852,talk,57-2,Oh dear!
,,,We've just received a report that some customers are stuck in the store!
,,,You'll have to build stairways leading to the 1st floor so they can go home!
,,,Please hurry.
853,talk,58-2,It sounds like the economy isn't doing very well at the moment.
,,,I hope this doesn't affect the number of customers we get...
854,talk,59-2,Uh-oh... It's raining.
,,,I hope this doesn't affect the number of customers we get...
855,talk,60-2,Yes!
,,,<0>'s popularity has reached its peak! And you know what that means--it's Fever time!
,,,We're about to be overrun with customers!
,,,During a Fever, you get hearts from customers just by having them come to the mall.
856,talk,61-2,Boss! We just got our first regular customer!
,,,When a customer becomes satisfied with the Quality of their favorite store, they become a regular.
,,,Regulars buy more products on each shopping trip, so they can really help contribute to your total sales.
,,,Try to get as many regulars as you can!
857,talk,62-2,In this menu, you can view information about your staff members, or hire new ones.
,,,Just remember that you have to pay a signing bonus when first hiring someone, so choose carefully.
858,talk,63-2,Hello.
,,,I've heard good things about the <0> at <1>, and was thinking about moving into the area.
,,,I'm working on a development project in the <2>, if you'd like to invest.
,,,Please think about it. I'll be waiting.
859,talk,64-2,Boss!
,,,Our popularity is at its peak again! It's Fever time!
860,talk,65-2,The "Special" menu lists some unique stores.
,,,Many of them are very popular with customers, but they can be difficult to get.
861,talk,66-2,Boss!
,,,We've got our first customer!
,,,I wonder which store they're going to visit...
862,talk,67-2,You can use this menu to hold sales.
,,,Customers are more likely to visit stores running sales, which should contribute to the mall's bottom line.
,,,Holding a sale does consume hearts, though, so don't go overboard.
863,talk,68-2,We can't hire them until our mall gets bigger.
,,,I can't wait until we become a mega-mall, can you?
864,talk,69-2,We just received an investment proposal from a customer.
,,,You can check it by opening the "Invest" menu.
865,talk,70-2,Boss?
,,,I noticed that you haven't been investing much.
,,,Investing can increase the number of customers we get, so I suggest you do it as often as you can.
866,talk,71-2,Boss?
,,,We don't have any floor managers.
,,,Select "Actions" > "Hire Staff" to hire a floor manager.
867,talk,72-2,Boss?
,,,It looks like we have some stores that aren't connected to the 1st floor.
,,,Build some stairs so customers can get to all of the stores.
868,talk,73-2,You successfully upgraded the store's stats by adding a new service.
,,,But doing that also increases the store's maintenance costs.
,,,If you find that the maintenance costs are too high, select a service and tap the "Off" button.
869,talk,74-2,We can finally start building stores underground.
,,,Some stores seem to work better underground, so go ahead and get building.
870,talk,75-2,There are <0> applicants.
871,talk,76-2,Welcome.
,,,I just got some new store plans in. Feel free to check them out.
872,talk,77-2,Our ranking went down from last year...
,,,Let's try to improve our sales next year!
873,talk,78-2,Hello. I'm from Pumpkin Products.
,,,I stopped by to see if you would be interested in buying some new store plans. That's our specialty, after all.
874,talk,79-2,Boss?
,,,We can now start to hold sales!
,,,Select "Actions" > "Hold Sale" to hold a sale at a particular store.
875,talk,80-2,We did it!
,,,We're finally #1 in the country!
,,,I'm so proud I could burst! It's all thanks to everybody's hard work!
,,,Of course, we'll keep working hard to keep <0> on top.
876,talk,81-2,It seems like the <1> on the <0> is thinking of starting a new service.
,,,It doesn't seem too expensive, and they are asking nicely...
,,,Why don't you look into it?
877,talk,82-2,You failed to add the new service...
,,,That's too bad. But I'm sure we learned something from the experience.
,,,You should have a bit better chance the next time you try.
,,,Feel free to try again, if you have the hearts.
878,talk,83-2,You've gone outside the buildable area.
,,,I've heard that when a mall goes up in rank, they can get permission to increase in size.
,,,Keep your sales up and maybe we can get bigger too!
879,talk,84-2,Boss?
,,,It looks like one of our stores can now go up in level.
,,,Tap the store to select it.
880,talk,85-2,In this menu, you can select a variety of advertising methods.
,,,Advertising increases the number of customers you get.
,,,Each advertising method will be automatically performed each month, so keep an eye on your funds.
881,talk,86-2,Our national ranking was #<0>.
,,,Unfortunately, we didn't do better than last time.
,,,There are special Sales Seasons in August and December of each year.
,,,Let's keep working toward our goals.
882,talk,87-2,Refer to the "Combos" list to see which stores go together to make combos.
,,,To make a combo, the stores must be on the same floor, and must be touching each other.
,,,Do your best to build as many combos as possible.
883,talk,88-2,Boss?
,,,Now that we're a 1-star mall, we can finally start expanding in size.
,,,To expand, select the project from the "Invest" menu.
,,,This is our chance to grow!
884,talk,89-2,We got a bonus from the National Association of Malls for our showing in the national rankings.
,,,We should use it to develop our mall.
885,talk,90-2,Boss?
,,,Our advertising doesn't seem to be having any effect thanks to the recession.
,,,This is a problem...
886,talk,92-2,Thank you.
,,,Here is the <0> Combo.
887,talk,93-2,Is there anything else you'd like?
888,talk,94-2,Here you can check a store's information.
,,,Blue numbers are boosted due to bonuses.
889,talk,95-2,We finally have 5 stars.
,,,Now we need to concentrate on improving sales.
890,talk,96-2,Boss?
,,,<0> has...
,,,...fulfilled the conditions for going up in rank!
,,,Let's hurry up and do it!
891,talk,97-2,<0> has finally become a 5-star mall!
,,,When I think of all the years that have passed since we first opened, it makes me close to tears...
,,,But we've still got work to do. Let's try to make <0> the best mall it can be!
892,talk,98-2,Boss?
,,,A bus company is asking us if we want to build a bus stop in our mall.
,,,You can check out the details of the proposal under the "Invest" menu.
893,talk,99-2,Boss?
,,,I think it's about time to build some escalators in our mall.
,,,You can check out the details of the proposal under the "Invest" menu.
894,talk,100-2,Boss?
,,,I think it's about time to build some elevators in our mall.
,,,You can check out the details of the proposal under the "Invest" menu.
895,talk,101-2,We haven't fulfilled the conditions for going up in rank yet.
896,talk,102-2,Boss?
,,,The National Association of Malls just sent some information on rank up requirements.
,,,Since we just started out, the first step is to become a 1-star mall.
,,,Here are the conditions for a 1-star mall.
897,talk,103-2,Let's do our best!
898,talk,104-2,Congratulations!
,,,The conditions for the next rank just arrived.
899,talk,105-2,Let's keep working hard toward the next rank.
900,talk,106-2,Boss?
,,,The National Association of Malls just sent the requirements for the next rank.
901,talk,107-2,We haven't received the conditions for the next rank yet.
902,talk,108-2,Boss?
,,,A train company is asking if we want to build a station in our mall.
,,,You can check out the details of the proposal under the "Invest" menu.
903,talk,109-2,Boss?
,,,The government just gave us approval to build a heliport. If we build one, helicopters can land at our mall!
,,,You can check out the details of the proposal under the "Invest" menu.
904,talk,110-2,Hello!
,,,I am #503. I have the most advanced shopping AI of all Kairobots.
,,,I lost my job due to the recent economic downturn, but luckily I've found a place for myself here.
,,,I heard you had an excellent lingerie store. I think I'll check it out...
,,,Feel free to invest in the Kairo Building if you like.
905,talk,111-2,Hello. It's me.
,,,I'm in town for the petroleum summit, and thought I would stop in to pick up a video game or two...
,,,By the way, just between you and me...
,,,I had planned to build a robot-themed amusement park nearby, but I'm overextended at the moment.
,,,So I'm looking for investors. If the amusement park gets built, I'd probably visit here every week...
,,,Farewell. I wish you good health.
906,talk,112-2,Hello. Remember me from somewhere? I just love knitting.
,,,One of my knitting friends told me about your wonderful mall, so I decided to pay it a visit.
,,,I'm thinking about submitting some mall-themed creations of mine for your next exhibition.
,,,Well, goodbye.
907,talk,113-2,Hello there.
,,,Until recently, I had been living at a nearby hot springs inn, eating bananas, but they kicked me out...
,,,I managed to make it all the way here, when by chance I found that I had won the lottery!
,,,So I've decided to stay here for the moment and enjoy some shopping. I'll see you around!
908,talk,116-2,We're completely sold out. Thanks for shopping with us!
909,talk,117-2,Hello there. You're the manager of <0>?
,,,I was very impressed with the Quality of the <1> I visited today!
910,talk,118-2,You just created a store combo!
,,,That can really help contribute to our sales. Try to get as many combos as you can!
911,talk,119-2,One of our stores has completely sold out.
,,,If a store is selling out before the end of the day, try increasing its stock.
,,,Selecting a store and starting a new service will sometimes increase its stock.
912,talk,120-2,I plan to tell all of my friends about <0>! We'll come shopping together!
913,talk,121-2,I'd like to contribute a little money.
,,,I hope you can use it to develop the mall even further.
914,talk,122-2,I just love this store!
,,,Please take these hearts with my compliments!
915,talk,123-2,I'd like to tell you about a new store I've heard of.
,,,I'd love it if you could build one here.
916,talk,124-2,We only need to fulfill one more condition and we can go up in rank!
,,,We're almost there!
917,talk,125-2,We can now build stores on the 5th floor and above.
,,,But we're going to need another floor manager soon.
,,,You can now select "Actions" > "Hire Staff."
,,,Try hiring a new floor manager now.
