1805,text,805-1,Well done. You've reached the end of the Lite Version of the game.
1806,text,806-1,In the Full Version, you can play as long as you like to develop the ultimate shopping mall.
1807,text,807-1,On the following screen, you will be able to access the site for the Full Version of the game.
1808,text,808-1,We hope to see you again soon!
1809,text,809-1,Scroll around on the screen to select a location. Touch the item while moving to make fine adjustments.
1810,text,810-1,To build a hallway, touch where you want to start building, then drag to the place you want it to stop.
1811,text,811-1,You can turn the display of the buildable areas on or off using the soft button at the bottom left.
1812,text,812-1,On the tenant info window, use the scroll bar to the right to scroll down and view more detailed information.
1813,text,813-1,Our national rank was #<0>. We got bonuses totaling <1>.
1814,text,814-1,I managed to make it all the way here, when by chance I found that I had won the lottery!
1815,text,815-1,Our national rank was #<0>. We got bonuses totaling <1>.
1816,text,816-1,I managed to make it all the way here, when by chance I found that I had won the lottery!
1817,text,817-1,Until recently, I had been living at a nearby hot springs inn, eating bananas, but they kicked me out...
1818,text,818-1,Hello there.
1819,text,819-1,So I've decided to stay here for the moment and enjoy some shopping. I'll see you around!
1820,text,820-1,The store with the highest sales this year was...
1821,text,821-1,Let's go see.
1822,text,822-1&824-1,Let's try to aim for the top of the rankings next year as well.
1823,text,823-1,The national rankings are based on more than sales. Store Reputation and Quality are also taken into account.
1824,text,825-1,<1>, with yearly sales of <0>.
1825,text,826-1,You can use the "Move" command to move an existing store or facility to an empty location.
1826,text,827-1,However, you cannot move items like stairs.
1827,text,828-1,Hints On
1828,text,829-1,Hints Off
1829,text,830-1&832-1,<0> in Monthly Sales
1830,text,831-1,According to our calculations, <0> has recently reached <1> in monthly sales. When reached by phone for comment, a part-time worker at the store said, "Well what do you know? This is the first I've heard of it." Inspiring stuff... Let's hope management will use a little of that money to bring in some new stores.
1831,text,833-1,We have just learned that <0> has surpassed <1> in sales. This news has sent shockwaves through the mall industry, as many try to discover this newcomer's secret. A member of our staff who secretly visited the mall incognito reported that the stores were attractive and well arranged, and that he enjoyed shopping there. In fact, he came home loaded down with bags full of souvenirs purchased without permission. We hope we will have enough money left to continue publication...
1832,text,834-1,<0> Spent!
1833,text,835-1,We have recently learned that a customer shopping at <0>'s <1> spent more than <2> in a single visit! The cashier could barely hide her surprise as the customer kept buying item after item. This is just more proof of the deep roots that <0> has put down in the community.
